  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management and Domestic Revenue Collection - PFM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Public Resource Management Programme in Somalia Phase 2 is designed to improve domestic revenue mobilisation and public financial management. It contributes (a) to Somalia&#x2019;s state-building project by supporting the inter-governmental policy dialogue on fiscal federalism; and (b) to the debt relief process under the Highly Indebted Poor Countries (HIPC) initiative by aiding reforms needed to meet HIPC Completion Point requirements and policy benchmarks of the IMF Staff Monitored Programme under the Extended Credit Facility.</narrative>
  </description>
